[I] Run executabls under a new DBus session for testing

[T] dbus-test-runner starts a private D-Bus session bus, runs a set of tasks
[T] and test programs inside it and reports their combined result. It is
[T] used to test applications and services that talk over D-Bus without
[T] touching the user's real session bus.

[U] https://launchpad.net/dbus-test-runner

[A] Dbus-test-runner Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

